    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you cast Summon Aberration, you can modify it so that it doesn't require Concentration. If you do so, the spell's duration becomes 1 minute for that casting, and the Aberration has Temporary Hit Points equal to your Warlock level plus your Charisma modifier when summoned. In addition, the first time each turn the Aberration hits a creature under the effect of your Hex, it deals extra Psychic damage to the target equal to the bonus damage of that spell.</p>",
